       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. REPORT-ERRORS.
      * Report Writer mistakes
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PRINT-FILE ASSIGN TO "out.txt".
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  PRINT-FILE REPORT IS SALES.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  REGION      PIC X(6).
       01  AMOUNT      PIC 9(4)V99.
       REPORT SECTION.
       RD  SALES
           CONTROLS ARE REGION
           PAGE LIMIT 20 HEADING 5 FIRST DETAIL 3.
       01  TYPE PAGE HEADING LINE 1.
           05  COLUMN 1  PIC X(10) VALUE "SALES".
           05  COLUMN 5  PIC X(5)  VALUE "PAGE".
       01  SALE-LINE TYPE DETAIL LINE PLUS 1.
           05  COLUMN 1  PIC X(6) SOURCE REGION.
           05  COLUMN 10 SOURCE AMOUNT.
       01  TYPE CONTROL FOOTING AMOUNT LINE PLUS 1.
           05  COLUMN 1  PIC ZZZ9.99 SUM AMOUNT.
       01  NO-TYPE LINE PLUS 1.
           05  COLUMN 1  PIC X VALUE "X".
       RD  ORPHAN.
       01  TYPE DETAIL LINE PLUS 1.
           05  COLUMN 1  PIC X VALUE "Y".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           OPEN OUTPUT PRINT-FILE.
           INITIATE SALES.
           GENERATE SALES-LINE.
           TERMINATE SALES.
           CLOSE PRINT-FILE.
           STOP RUN.
